WEBVTT

00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:12.779
Wake up.
醒醒

00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:30.546
- (soft growling)
- Aslan?
亚斯蓝？

00:00:53.569 --> 00:00:55.488
(both grunting)

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:07.083
- Ah!
- Ah!

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.837
(Lucy) No, stop!
不 别打了

00:01:32.984 --> 00:01:34.944
Prince Caspian?
凯斯宾王子？

00:01:35.027 --> 00:01:37.613
Yes? And who are you?
是的 你是谁？

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:39.699
(Susan) Peter!
彼得！

00:01:49.584 --> 00:01:52.795
- High King Peter.
- I believe you called.
彼得国王
我相信是你吹了号角

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:56.299
Well, yes, but...
I thought you'd be older.
是…不过我以为你们会大一点

00:01:57.341 --> 00:01:59.761
If you like, we could
come back in a few years...
你想的话
我们可以晚几年再来

00:01:59.844 --> 00:02:03.973
No. No, that's all right. You're just...
不
不 没关系 只不过…

00:02:04.056 --> 00:02:07.018
You're not exactly what I expected.
你们不像我想的那样

00:02:10.188 --> 00:02:12.648
- Neither are you.
- (softly growls)
你们也是

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:15.610
A common enemy unites
even the oldest of foes.
敌人团聚回报古老的死对头

00:02:15.693 --> 00:02:19.947
We have anxiously awaited
your return, my liege.
我们热切期盼你回来 主上

00:02:20.031 --> 00:02:22.325
Our hearts and swords
are at your service.
我们全心全意效忠于你

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.160
Oh, my gosh, he is so cute.
老天 他好可爱

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:27.580
- Who said that?
- Sorry.
是谁说的？
对不起

00:02:27.663 --> 00:02:29.123
Oh. Uh...
是谁说的？
对不起

00:02:29.207 --> 00:02:32.543
Your Majesty,
with the greatest respect,
陛下 请听我言

00:02:32.627 --> 00:02:36.631
I do believe "courageous,"
"courteous," or "chivalrous"
我相信“勇敢”“有礼貌”
或“有骑士风范”会更适合

00:02:36.714 --> 00:02:38.966
might more befit a knight of Narnia.
一位纳尼亚武士

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.636
Well, at least we know
some of you can handle a blade.
至少我们知道
你们有人剑术了得

00:02:41.719 --> 00:02:44.722
Yes, indeed. And I have
recently put it to good use,
是的 我最近更善用技能

00:02:44.806 --> 00:02:46.849
securing weapons
for your army, sire.
为您的军队取得武器

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:51.187
Good. Because we're going
to need every sword we can get.
很好 因为我们需要每一把剑

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:54.774
Well, then you will probably
be wanting yours back.
那么您也许会想要回您的

00:03:14.377 --> 00:03:17.380
How much did they take?
他们夺走了多少？

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.882
Enough weapons and armor
for two regiments.
足足两个军团的武器和盔甲

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:23.344
But... there's more.
可是…还有别的

00:03:26.097 --> 00:03:29.767
"You were right to fear the woods."
“害怕森林是对的”

00:03:29.851 --> 00:03:34.522
- "X"?
- Caspian. The tenth.
“Ｘ”？
凯斯宾十世

00:03:34.605 --> 00:03:38.317
I apologize, my lord.
The blame is mine.
我道歉 陛下 这都要怪我

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:40.736
I know.
我知道

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.114
Tell me, general...
告诉我 将军

00:03:44.699 --> 00:03:46.534
...how many men did you lose?
你失去了多少手下？

00:03:46.617 --> 00:03:50.246
- None, my lord.
- None?
没有 陛下
没有？

00:03:50.329 --> 00:03:55.501
They came like ghosts, in the dead
of night. We never saw them.
他们在黑夜里如鬼魅般摸进来
我们没看到他们

00:03:57.336 --> 00:04:00.172
Then how do you explain your injuries?
那你怎么解释伤兵的事？

00:04:09.348 --> 00:04:11.559
I asked...
我问你

00:04:11.642 --> 00:04:13.895
...how many men were killed
在纳尼亚人的攻击中

00:04:13.978 --> 00:04:17.732
during this bloody Narnian attack?
有多少人丧生？

00:04:19.191 --> 00:04:23.529
Of which you were a fortunate survivor.
在你幸运存活的这场攻击中

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:27.992
General...
将军

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.703
...how many?
多少人？

00:04:45.384 --> 00:04:47.303
Three.
三个人

00:04:55.519 --> 00:04:58.314
I apologize, Lord Sopespian.
我道歉 苏普皮阁下

00:04:59.315 --> 00:05:04.278
Caspian is not a victim
of this savage uprising.
凯斯宾不是这场暴动的受害者

00:05:04.362 --> 00:05:05.905
He is the instigator.
他是煽动者

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:14.246
It seems Narnia
is in need of a new king.
看来纳尼亚需要一位新的国王

00:05:23.631 --> 00:05:25.716
(Peter) Well, it's good you have troops,
虽然军队有了

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:29.512
but we need some fortifications.
Somewhere to train.
我们还需要防御工事

00:05:33.099 --> 00:05:36.727
So? What are they like?
所以 他们是怎么样的人？

00:05:36.811 --> 00:05:41.357
Malcontents, complainers,
stubborn as mules in the morning.
叛逆 爱抱怨
早上还像骡子一样倔强

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:44.026
Oh. So you like them, then.
所以你喜欢他们啰

00:05:45.277 --> 00:05:47.113
Well enough.
还可以

